> h0(x: u8) = x
> h1(x: u8) = x+0
> h2(x: u8) = x*1
> h3(x: u8) = (x)
> h4(x: u8) = x-0
> equiv h0 h1
h0 and h1 are equal on the domain of h0 (exhaustive)
> equiv h1 h2
h1 and h2 are equal on the domain of h1 (exhaustive)
> equiv h2 h3
h2 and h3 are equal on the domain of h2 (exhaustive)
> equiv h3 h4
h3 and h4 are equal on the domain of h3 (exhaustive)
> equiv h0 h4
h0 and h4 are equal on the domain of h0 (exhaustive)
